            "review_text": "David K\nSao Paulo, SP15 contributions\n0\nOne of the best venues in HCMC. Full stop.\nDec 2016 • Friends\nI discovered Panam 8 or 9 month ago when they were still in the Japanese District. Food and staff were great. Now that they moved to Pasteur, it is even better !\nOwners are very welcoming and friendly, food and drinks are excellent for a very fair price, and their events are always great fun. \nIn my top 3 venues in HCMC.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 19, 2017",
