            "review_text": "backpacksteveo\n3 contributions\n0\nGreat place to hang out\nOct 2016 • Solo\nI've spent a lot of time there as I was visiting HCMC. It's a great place to hang : the food is a choice of different kind of Kebabs which are all nice, made with home made sauces. I liked their tap beers, and they have cocktails as well. You can chill all day on their couch, playing board games, singing karaoke at night, listening to live music, etc... Definitely worth a try if you're around. Ah and the staff is friendly and quick. What else could we want ?\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2017",
