            "review_text": "yslayra66\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nWelcoming and friendly\nOct 2016 • Friends\nMy husband and I came there looking for good falafel and kebab. \nFinally found this restaurant hidden behind Cuba la casa del mojito...and it became our HQ!\nGood and not expensive food (falafel is a must-try, you can choose different sauces for your sandwich or plate), great choice of beers (also have wine), friendly owners and staff, games available, karaoke, humor and fun!\nYou can come alone, in couple, in family or with friends for lunch or dinner, for work or gaming in the afternoon.\nWe really love this place where it feels like home and wish for others to discover this hidden gem!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2016",
